    "{\"scene_type\":\"natural roadside environmental photograph with a humorous Chinese notice sign\",\"gen_"
    "brief\":\"A relaxed, photorealistic environmental photograph at pedestrian eye level along a quiet rural"
    " road. A battered dark green notice sign stands on the gravel-and-grass shoulder, naturally integrated i"
    "nto the landscape and occupying approximately one fifth of the image area. The road fills much of the le"
    "ft and lower frame and curves toward distant trees; sky, irregular foliage and ample foreground provide "
    "breathing room. Preserve the main sign body's approximately 30-degree perspective yaw, left edge nearer "
    "and right edge receding, plus its 15-degree clockwise lean in the image plane. Keep the camera and horiz"
    "on level. Two visibly bent, kinked galvanized posts bow right above firmly planted bases and remain atta"
    "ched to the board. The sign has a pronounced LOCALIZED, asymmetric sheet-metal fold, not a uniformly cur"
    "ved or globally bent surface. Most of the left, center and lower board remains approximately flat in its"
    " existing orientation. Only an upper-right patch folds toward the camera approximately 35 degrees relati"
    "ve to that main plane, along a diagonal plastic crease running from near (820, 555) at the top edge to n"
    "ear (980, 950) at the right edge. The corner tip projects near (1030, 605). This produces two distinct c"
    "onnected surface orientations, a sharply kinked outline, an irregular crease ridge, small compression wr"
    "inkles, chipped paint along the fold and a narrow self-shadow. The bent patch is part of the same contin"
    "uous metal sheet, not a detached plate, pasted-on triangle or missing chunk. Avoid a smooth cylindrical "
    "bow, a symmetrical V-fold, a fold across the entire width or mere additional rigid rotation. Keep the lo"
    "cal damage clearly visible but do not fold the printed face shut or hide substantial text. Add restraine"
    "d edge dents, rusty scratches, exposed dull metal and two small punctures in blank margins. No flames, s"
    "moke, weapons or active conflict. Ordinary photographic perspective, soft afternoon daylight, restrained"
    " colors, dust and grass at the feet; no strong glare, dramatic spotlight or artificial background blur. "
    "The scuffed thin white border follows both the overall perspective and the local crease. The official de"
    "sign contrasts with the humorous essay. The three text objects are a centered white heading and two body"
    " columns read down the left column then down the right. Every glyph is printed on the physical metal: mo"
    "st text follows the original yaw and clockwise lean, while the upper-right text fragments crossing the c"
    "rease bend with the local folded patch. Their baselines change direction at the crease and their local s"
    "pacing foreshortens naturally; no floating upright text, straight lettering across a bent surface, dupli"
    "cated words or erased passages. Preserve the near left column's larger scale and far right column's redu"
    "ced scale. Axis-aligned text boxes are enclosing guides, not visible rectangles; their envelopes may ove"
    "rlap, but actual printed columns remain separate. Approximate base-plane column guides in top-left, top-"
    "right, bottom-right, bottom-left order are: left (523, 567), (768, 632), (590, 1299), (345, 1233); right"
    " (784, 666), (1010, 726), (848, 1331), (622, 1270). These guide the undamaged layout only; locally warp "
    "the upper-right fragments to the folded surface instead of enforcing a single planar projection across t"
    "he entire sign. The text objects' identity strings are the exact Chinese lettering. Preserve every chara"
    "cter and explicit newline, including blank paragraph lines; never print escape sequences literally. Use "
    "a bold Chinese sans-serif heading approximately 49 pixels high before rotation, body lettering approxima"
    "tely 12 pixels on the near side decreasing toward the far side, and approximately 16-pixel near-column a"
    "nd 15-pixel far-column line spacing before projection. Keep six paragraphs per column and the entire ess"
    "ay. The heading remains noticeable while the body appears as naturally small, dense information at this "
    "distance. Do not enlarge the sign to fill the frame. No additional lettering, logos or watermarks.\",\"e"
    "lements\":[{\"type\":\"panel\",\"salience\":\"background\",\"identity\":\"An expansive, natural rural ro"
    "adside setting. Muted blue sky and distant treetops fill the upper area. A quiet gray asphalt road enter"
    "s from the lower left and bends toward a vanishing point near the center-left, with an irregular gravel "
    "shoulder on its right. Layered green trees, shrubs and tall grass frame the scene, especially along the "
