    "foliage shadows create a casual, believable outdoor photograph. Keep the space behind the sign free of i"
    "ntrusive branches.\",\"bbox\":[-880,-584,880,584]},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"salience\":\"secondary\",\"identi"
